                    Types of Variables
                    ==================
1.
Local Variables
================                    

Any variable declared inside a METHOD is called local variable and do not have any default value

2.
Instance variable
==================

Declared inside class


3.
static variable
================

also declared inside a class with "static" keyword and have default value acc to their datatype



    Default value of instance and static Variables
    ==============================================

    Datatype                DF value
    ======================================

    int,long,short,byte       0
    boolean                  false
    double                   0.0
    float                    0.0
    char                     0(0 unicode)
